              "units": 1.1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "log_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Logging boundary",
          "guidance": "Do not leave a known access, alarm, occupancy, utility, or custody exception without an authorized owner and documented limit. Avoid confrontation and use approved emergency routes. Never record alarm codes, safe combinations, or reusable credentials here. Follow applicable closing, safety, privacy, and security policy and route judgment to the authorized reviewer."
        }
      ]
    },
